OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed for 'sickening      
OL,4,Aexploitation' of girl                  
OL,6,FA man who groomed and sexually abused a
OL,7,Fteenage girl over a number of years in 
OL,8,Fa case police described as a "sickening
OL,9,Fcampaign of sexual exploitation" has   
OL,10,Fbeen jailed.                           
OL,12,FParvez Hussain from Birmingham targeted
OL,13,Fthe girl, under 16 at the time, because
OL,14,Fof her age and vulnerability and       
OL,15,Fregularly contacted her offering       
OL,16,Fsweets, alcohol, vapes and drugs, West 
OL,17,FMidlands Police said.                  
OL,19,FAs well as raping her, the 45-year-old 
OL,20,Fdrove her to different addresses where 
OL,21,Fother men abused her.                  
